{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/svn' data-target='computer\/program\/svn' data-title='SVN'>\r\n\t\t\tSVN\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Create a new project folder directly in the repository.","label":"Import in Place","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/svn\/ankhsvn","label":"AnkhSVN","url":"\/computer\/program\/svn\/ankhsvn"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/svn\/update","label":"Update","url":"\/computer\/program\/svn\/update"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCreate a new project folder directly in the repository.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf you are using one of the standard layouts you will probably want to create this as a sub-folder of trunk rather than in the repository root.how things are organised.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCheckout the SVN folder over the top of the folder you want to import.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tYou will get a warning that the local folder is not empty. Ignore the warning.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNow you have a versioned top level folder with unversioned content.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUse TortoiseSVN ? Add... on this versioned folder to add some or all of the content.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tYou can add and remove files, set svn:ignore properties on folders and make any other changes you need to.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCommit the top level folder, and you have a new versioned tree, and a local working copy, created from your existing folder.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/svn\/import_in_place\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/svn\/import_in_place\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/svn\/ankhsvn' data-target='computer\/program\/svn\/ankhsvn' data-title='AnkhSVN' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>AnkhSVN<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/svn\/update' data-target='computer\/program\/svn\/update' data-title='Update' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Update<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/svn' data-target='computer\/program\/svn' data-title='SVN'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/program\/svn.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SVN<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/di